    <string name="quick_tips_title">📸 How to Take Consistent Photos</string>
    <string name="quick_tips_message">For accurate classification, follow these steps:\n\n1️⃣ BACKGROUND: Plain white/light surface\n2️⃣ LIGHTING: Natural daylight (near window)\n3️⃣ DISTANCE: 13–17 cm (hand-width away)\n4️⃣ ANGLE: 45° to mushroom\n5️⃣ FOCUS: Tap on mushroom cap\n6️⃣ FRAMING: Center in guide frame\n\n💡 Same setup = Same results!</string>
